  "notes": "{体験|たいけん}する means to personally experience something firsthand.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {体験|たいけん}する: to experience\n- {体験|たいけん}できる: can experience\n- {体験|たいけん}{学習|がくしゅう}: hands-on learning\n- {体験|たいけん}{談|だん}: personal account\n- {体験|たいけん}{入学|にゅうがく}: trial enrollment\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {経験|けいけん}する: to experience (broader, includes accumulated experience)\n- {体験|たいけん}: emphasizes direct, firsthand experience\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Pattern: 〜を{体験|たいけん}する",
